 * Gateway HTTP Front Controller
 *
 * The HTTP entry point for the generic Gateway SPI (models/gateway/http/HttpGateway.bx).
 *
 * Usage:
 * 1. Configure and register a gateway at startup:
 *    aiGatewayRegistry().register( aiGateway( "http", { secret: "shared-secret" } ) )
 *
 * 2. Send requests to this endpoint:
 *    POST http://localhost/~bxai/gateway.bxm/gateways/myGateway/events
 *    GET  http://localhost/~bxai/gateway.bxm/interactions/{requestID}
 *    POST http://localhost/~bxai/gateway.bxm/interactions/{requestID}/decisions
 *
 *    Signed requests (inbound events, decisions) require X-Signature, X-Timestamp,
 *    and X-Nonce headers — see models/gateway/http/GatewaySecurity.bx.
